The '''{{zone|Scarleton Minion Shop}}''' is a sub-location of {{zone|Scarleton}}. [[Hilda]] sells Tier 12 Nether related [[Minions]] here.

{{ZoneText|Buy Tier XII minions!}}

== Purpose ==
[[Hilda]] sells Tier 12 versions of the {{Item|Mycelium Minion}}, {{Item|Quartz Minion}}, {{Item|Nether Wart Minion}}, {{Item|Glowstone Minion}}, {{Item|Magma Cube Minion}}, {{Item|Blaze Minion}} and {{Item|Ghast Minion}}.

